  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Technical assistance to complement the implementation of the 2nd phase of the budget support to PVET</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Technical assistance to complement the implementation of the 2nd phase of the budget support to PVET - This Action aims to fund a Cooperation Facility for Tajikistan, providing the European Commission with the possibility to finance small-scale activities that are needed for the achievement of the objectives of the Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument (NDICI-Global Europe), as articulated in the country&#xbf;s MIP priority areas. This Measures will be backing the implementation of the EU&#xbf;s strategic priorities in Tajikistan, with a particular focus on Global Gateway. Activities may cover, inter alia, capacity development; technical assistance; support to policy dialogue, including via events, conferences, studies, surveys, fellowships, or exchange platforms; actions to support the participation of the country in EU Programmes and cooperation with EU Agencies and Civil Society Organisations, and strategic communications. They will support all MIP objectives, i.e.: (i) inclusive green and digital economy; (ii) human development; (iii) natural resource management, efficiency and resilience building.</narrative>
  </description>
